      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 1,
          "id": "h-conclusion"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Conclusion"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The prototype reduced water use by 34% over a four-week field trial while keeping soil moisture within the target band. Future work includes weather-forecast integration and a mobile dashboard."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 1,
          "id": "h-ack",
          "numbered": false
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Acknowledgment"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "We thank the campus farm for lending us the test plots, and our advisor for weekly feedback throughout the project."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "appendixStart"
